  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "\u0110\u1EA5u s\u0129"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\n- Khi tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i
    ta, gi\u1EBFt m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED3ng minh."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 ma \u0111\xF3i, c\xF2n g\u1ECDi c\xF4 h\u1ED3n hay ng\u1EA1
    qu\u1EF7 \u2014 vong linh ch\u1EBFt \u0111\xF3i, ch\u1EBFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
    ho\u1EB7c kh\xF4ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u1EDD c\xFAng. Ta lang thang xin \u0103n
    v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ng\u01B0\u1EDDi s\u1ED1ng c\xFAng ch\xE1o, g\u1EA1o
    mu\u1ED1i v\xE0o th\xE1ng B\u1EA3y \xE2m l\u1ECBch."
